# Native fullscreen (#38 acceptance): the panels are hidden on the fullscreen display, the window
# keeps its tab, and it never vanishes across focus-workspace-down/up (Fn+S / Fn+W).
# Needs the runner to hold Accessibility + Automation (System Events) for `fullscreen`.
open 1 as f
settle
require workspace-count f1 1
focus f1
settle
require active f1
expect onscreen f1
shot windowed

fullscreen f1 on
settle
expect fullscreen f1
expect tab f1
expect onscreen f1
expect panels-hidden f1
shot fullscreen

run focus-workspace-down
settle
expect tab f1
expect fullscreen f1
shot away

run focus-workspace-up
settle
expect tab f1
expect fullscreen f1
expect active f1
expect onscreen f1
expect panels-hidden f1
shot back

# Down/up again: the vanishing bug showed on the second round trip as often as the first.
run focus-workspace-down
settle
run focus-workspace-up
settle
expect tab f1
expect onscreen f1

fullscreen f1 off
settle
expect tab f1
expect not-fullscreen f1
expect not-parked f1
expect onscreen f1
shot exited
